|content1=
* April - '''JiJieHao''' is officially established. <ref name="JiJieHao formed">{{cite web|url=https://weibo.com/7312190286/MaR9CqPhv|title=集结号电子竞技俱乐部JJH勇敢前行！|trans_title=JiJieHao brave forward!|date=2022-10-18|language={{Flag|cn}} Simplified Chinese|author='''JiJieHao'''}}</ref>

|content2=
* July 7th - '''JiJieHao''' bench [[MarT1n]]. <ref name="martin benched">{{cite_web|url=https://weibo.com/7312190286/Ja5pUkjSV|title=声明|trans_title=Announcement|language={{Flag|cn}} Simplified Chinese|date=2020-07-07|author='''JiJieHao'''}}</ref>
* July 24th - '''JiJieHao''' loan [[MarT1n]] to [[OneThree]]. <ref name="martin loan">{{cite_web|url=https://csgo.com.hk/2020/07/26/onethree-to-borrow-mart1n-from-the-jie-jiehao/news/|title=OneThree 向JiJieHao借用MarT1n|trans_title=OneThree borrows MarT1n from JiJieHao|language={{Flag|hk}} Traditional Chinese|date=2020-07-26|publisher=[[TomorrowLAN]]|author=[[LemonFox]]}}</ref>
* August 1st - [[Starry]] rejoins '''JiJieHao''' on trial. <ref name="starry trial">{{cite_web|url=https://csgo.com.hk/2020/08/11/jmt-trial-training-wangj-parted-ways-with-ayaya-to-prepare-for-the-funspark-qualifiers/news/|title=JMT試訓WANGJ 與Ayaya分道揚鑣 將備戰FunSpark預選賽|trans_title=JMT trial WANGJ and Ayaya part ways to prepare for FunSpark qualifiers|language={{Flag|hk}} Traditional Chinese|date=2020-08-11|publisher=[[TomorrowLAN]]|author=[[LemonFox]]}}</ref>
* August 3rd - '''JiJieHao''' part ways with [[WANGJ]]. <ref name="-wangj">{{cite_web|url=https://t.bilibili.com/419269686620296595|title=今天我离开啦 集结号战队|trans_title=Today I leave JiJieHao|language={{Flag|cn}} Simplified Chinese|date=2020-08-03|author=[[WANGJ]]}}</ref>
* August 10th - '''JiJieHao''' add [[DesTiny]] on trial. <ref name="FunSpark team list">{{cite web|url=https://csgo.com.hk/2020/09/03/funspark-ulti-2020-asian-qualifiers-are-about-to-start/tournament/|date=2020-09-03 |trans_title=FunSpark Asia Qual Preview|language={{Flag|hk}} Traditional Chinese|title=FunSpark ULTI 2020 亞洲預選賽 即將開始 |publisher=[[TomorrowLAN]]|author=[[LemonFox]]}}</ref>
* August 25th - [[Starry]] completes his trial successfully and joins '''JiJieHao''' on a permanent basis. <ref name="FunSpark team list"/>
* September 1st - [[DesTiny]] completes his trial successfully and joins '''JiJieHao''' on a permanent basis. <ref name="FunSpark team list"/>
* October 1st - [[MarT1n]] is acquired by [[Wings Up Gaming]]. <ref name="mart1n not7">{{cite web|url=https://csgo.com.hk/2020/10/29/lynnvisionwingsupoct2020change/news/|date=2020-10-29 |trans_title=Wings Up buyout MarT1n from JJH and part ways with Not7|language={{Flag|hk}} Traditional Chinese|title=Lynn Vision Wings Up 分別迎來變動 LVG XinKoiNg休息 Mr.mao重返隊伍 Wings Up買斷MaTr1n Not7離隊 |publisher=[[TomorrowLAN]]|author=[[LemonFox]]}}</ref>

|content3=
* January 4th - [[MAD]] leaves '''JiJieHao''' to join [[Huat Zai]] on trial. <ref name="-mad">{{cite_web|url=https://csgo.com.hk/2021/01/21/mad-turns-to-after-gaming-from-huat-zai/news/|title=MAD從Huat Zai轉投After Gaming|trans_title=MAD switches from Huat Zai to After Gaming|language={{Flag|hk}} Traditional Chinese|date=2021-01-21|publisher=[[TomorrowLAN]]|author=[[LemonFox]]}}</ref>
* February 2nd - [[Starry]] leaves to join [[Phoenix Gaming (Chinese team)|Phoenix]]. <ref name="-starry2">{{inside source|source=deleted Weibo post}}</ref>

|content4=
* July 19th - '''JiJieHao''' add [[ImpressioN]] on trial. <ref name="impression trial">{{cite_web|url=https://csgo.com.hk/2022/08/03/the-transfer-and-transfer-news-july-31-to-august-2-is-the-second-round-of-talks-between-g2-and-boombl4/news/|title=隊伍調動及轉會消息 (7月31日至8月2日) G2與Boombl4談判告吹|trans_title=Team relocation and transfer news (July 31 to August 2) Negotiations between G2 and Boombl4 failed|language={{Flag|hk}} Traditional Chinese|date=2022-08-03|publisher=[[TomorrowLAN]]|author=[[LemonFox]]}}</ref>
* August 15th - '''JiJieHao''' part ways with [[ImpressioN]]. <ref name="-impression">{{cite_web|url=https://csgo.com.hk/2022/08/22/message-from-team-transfer-and-transfer-16-august-to-21-august-ence-to-enter-valde-and-snopayu/news/|title=隊伍調動及轉會消息 (8月16日至8月21日) ENCE簽入valde及SunPayus|trans_title=Team relocation and transfer news (August 16 to August 21) ENCE signs valde and SunPayus|language={{Flag|hk}} Traditional Chinese|date=2022-08-22|publisher=[[TomorrowLAN]]|author=[[LemonFox]]}}</ref>

|content5=
* November 7th - '''JiJieHao''' sign an international roster consisting of [[m1N1]], [[SaVage]], [[ISSAA]], [[keen]], and [[DavCost]]. <ref name="jijie Int 2023">{{cite_web|url=https://weibo.com/7312190286/Nrtv9iwTy|title=集结号电子竞技俱乐部CS2分部正式成立|trans_title=JiJieHao Counter-Strike 2 Officially Established|language={{Flag|cn}} Simplified Chinese|date=2023-11-07|author='''JiJieHao'''}}</ref>
* December 15th - '''JiJieHao''' sign [[bullet (Russian player)|bullet]] as the team's coach. <ref name="+bullet">{{inside source|source=bullet}}</ref>

|content6=
* January 6th - '''JiJieHao''' replace [[SaVage]] and [[keen]] with [[Remind]] and [[El1an]]. <ref name="remind and el1an">{{inside source}}</ref>
* January 15th - '''JiJieHao''' replace [[Remind]] with [[ViTaL]]. <ref name="+vital">{{inside source|source=bullet}}</ref>
* March 26th - '''JiJieHao''' part ways with [[El1an]] and [[Bullet_(Russian_player)|bullet]]. <ref name="-elian">{{cite_web|url=https://twitter.com/el1ancsgo/status/1772463194348404876|title=Free agent, it was interesting and rly fun experience to play in asia, but I want to continue in eu/cis|date=2024-03-26|author=[[El1an]]}}</ref><ref name="-bullet">{{cite_web|url=https://twitter.com/bullet_cs2/status/1772338945616920692|title=Steps down from coaching role in JJH|date=2024-03-26|author=[[Bullet_(Russian_player)|bullet]]}}</ref>
* May 11th - '''JiJieHao''' part ways with [[DavCost]]. <ref name="-davcost">{{cite_web|url=https://twitter.com/davcost9n/status/1789355143344890036|title=Free agent , looking for a team highly motivated to compete retweet is appreciated|date=2024-05-11|author=[[DavCost]]}}</ref>
* June 10th - '''JiJieHao''' part ways with [[ViTaL]] and acquire [[0SAMAS]] from [[Onyx Ravens]]. <ref name="+0SAMAS">{{cite_web|url=https://x.com/OXReSports/status/1800173632423108824|title=اليوم نودع أحد أبطالنا للعبة #CS2 في بداية مشواره الجديد مع فريق JiJieHao|language={{Flag|sa}} Arabic|trans_title=Today we bid farewell to one of our heroes of the game #CS2 as he begins his new career with the JiJieHao team|date=2024-06-10|author=[[Onyx Ravens]]}}</ref>
* June 30th - '''JiJieHao''' sign [[Kjaerbye]] and acquire [[dennyslaw]] from [[500]]. <ref name="+duo">{{cite web|url=https://www.hltv.org/news/39324/kjaerbye-and-dennyslaw-link-up-with-jijiehao|title=Kjaerbye and dennyslaw link up with JiJieHao|date=2024-06-30|author=[[MIRAA]]|publisher=[[HLTV]]}}</ref>
*August 20th - '''JiJieHao''' bench [[Kjaerbye]]. <ref name="kjaer bench">{{cite web|url=https://www.hltv.org/news/39669/jijiehao-bench-kjaerbye|title=JiJieHao bench Kjaerbye|date=2024-08-20|author=[[king_dempz]]|publisher=[[HLTV]]}}</ref>
*September 26th - '''JiJieHao''' part ways with [[ISSAA]]. <ref name="-issaa">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/issaa_csgo/status/1839336053247004961|title=Hello|date=2024-09-26|author=[[ISSAA]]}}</ref>
*October 17th - '''JiJieHao''' part ways with [[0SAMAS]], re-sign [[ISSAA]], and sign [[Aaron]] and [[bibu]]. <ref name="oct changes">{{cite web|url=https://www.hltv.org/news/40074/jijiehao-sign-ex-pera-duo-issaa-returns|title=JiJieHao sign ex-PERA duo; ISSAA returns|date=2024-10-17|publisher=[[HLTV]]|author=[[MIRAA]]}}</ref>

|content7=
* February 24th - '''JiJieHao''' bench [[ISSAA]] and sign [[BOROS]]. <ref name="+BOROS -ISSAA">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/jijiehaocs2/status/1893933162473926975|title=We’re beyond excited to welcome @boroscs to the team!|date=2025-02-24|author='''JiJieHao'''}}</ref>
* April 3rd - '''JiJieHao''' bench [[dennyslaw]] and [[Aaron]], re-instate [[ISSAA]] to the starting lineup, and re-sign [[0SAMAS]]. <ref name="apr25">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/jijiehaocs2/status/1907837582433554702|title=Roster Update|date=2025-04-03|author='''JiJieHao'''}}</ref>
* July 15th - [[Aaron]] is acquired by [[Dynamo Eclot]]. <ref name="-Aaron">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/dynamoeclot/status/1945151764245680452|title=And now the boys just have to learn Hungarian|date=2025-07-15|author=[[Dynamo Eclot]]}}</ref>
* July 19th - '''JiJieHao''' release [[BOROS]]. <ref name="-BOROS">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/jijiehaocs2/status/1946692332918641051|title=Today we’re parting ways with @boroscs|date=2025-07-19|author='''JiJieHao'''}}</ref>
* July 24th - '''JiJieHao''' acquire [[kumao]] from [[ALLINNERS]]. <ref name="+kumao">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/jijiehaocs2/status/1948340238822023231|title=Welcome Kumao!|date=2025-07-24|author='''JiJieHao'''}}</ref>
* August 1st - '''JiJieHao''' part ways with [[dennyslaw]] following the expiration of his contract. <ref name="-denny">{{inside source|source=dennyslaw}}</ref>
* September 30th - '''JiJieHao''' part ways with [[Loord]]. <ref name="-loord">{{inside source|source=Loord}}</ref>
* October 12th - [[kumao]] is acquired by [[ALLINNERS]]. <ref name="-kumao">{{cite web|url=https://t.me/allinners_team/108|title=cs2 roster update|date=2025-10-12|author=[[ALLINNERS]]}}</ref>
* November 13th - '''JiJieHao''' part ways with [[ISSAA]]. <ref name="-issaa 2025">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/issaa_csgo/status/1989049304984809804|title=As of today, my team and I have mutually decided to part ways|date=2025-11-13|author=[[ISSAA]]}}</ref>
* November 14th - '''JiJieHao''' sign [[BOROS]]. <ref name="+boros">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/jijiehaocs2/status/1989297682037314017|title=We’re pleased to announce that Boros is officially returning to our roster|date=2025-11-14|author='''JiJieHao'''}}</ref>

|content8=
* February 4th - '''JiJieHao''' sign [[mithR]] as coach. <ref name="+mithr">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/mithRTV/status/2018972811235303813|title=Happy to share I will be staying with @jijiehaocs2 throughout 2026 after having reached back-to-back grand finals at our last two events|date=2026-02-04|author=[[mithR]]}}</ref>
* February 9th - '''JiJieHao''' part ways with [[BOROS]] following the termination of his contract. <ref name="-boros 2026">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/boroscs/status/2020866065333424613|title=Hello everyone, I want to announce that I am a free agent we just terminated the contract together with @jijiehaocs2 I am looking for a team I am so motivated it was good 2 months we reached 2 finals great experience, thanks to the team @sinnopsyy_ mini osamas @Bibu_cs  @mithRTV|date=2026-02-09|author=[[BOROS]]}}</ref>

}}

