'''Kaleido Gaming''' ''(formerly known as '''NinJa''')'' is an organization-less [[:Category:China|Chinese]] ''[[Counter-Strike 2]]'' team that formed after [[Unsettled Resentment]] parted ways with the core of their first lineup. The team was re-formed on April 1st, 2026 after [[Morningstar]] parted ways with their roster.

==Timeline==
{{tabs dynamic
|name1=2025
|name2=2026
|This=2
|content1=
* March 10th - The core lineup of [[Unsettled Resentment]] forms a new team called '''NinJa'''. <ref name="ninja">{{cite web|url=https://www.bilibili.com/opus/1053326195227099143|title=On March 10, 2025, the core lineup of UR (Unsettled Resentment) formed a new team NinJa|date=2025-04-08|author=[[YINXING]]|publisher=[[MythYLHB]]}}</ref>
* June 26th - Team '''NinJa''' rename to '''Kaleido Gaming'''. <ref name="kaleido gaming">{{cite web|url=https://www.bilibili.com/opus/1096841532564045845|title=NinJa rename to Kaleido Gaming|date=2025-08-03|author=[[YINXING]]|publisher=[[MythYLHB]]}}</ref>
* July 11th - '''Kaleido Gaming''' part ways with [[risk (Chinese player)|risk]] and [[expSasiKi]] and add [[Miami]] and [[suki]]. <ref name="change duo">{{cite web|url=https://www.bilibili.com/opus/1096841532564045845|title=On July 11th, Kaleido Gaming parted ways with risk and expSasiKi, while Miami and suki were added to the roster|date=2025-08-03|author=[[YINXING]]|publisher=[[MythYLHB]]}}</ref>
* August 15th - '''Kaleido Gaming''' part ways with [[Miami]] and add [[expSasiKi]]. <ref name="-miami+expsasiki">{{cite web|url=https://www.bilibili.com/opus/1101070138328743938|title=Kaleido Gaming replace Miami with expSasiKi|date=2025-08-15|author=[[YINXING]]|publisher=[[MythYLHB]]}}</ref>
* September 23rd - '''Kaleido Gaming''' part ways with [[2X2X]] and add [[rubeN (Chinese player)|rubeN]]. <ref name="-2x2x+ruben">{{inside source|date=2025-09-23|source=YINXING}}</ref>
* December 1st - '''Kaleido Gaming''' are signed by [[Morningstar]]. <ref name="morningstar">{{cite web|url=https://www.bilibili.com/opus/1141107716068999172|title=Kaleido Gaming are signed by Morningstar|date=2025-12-01|author=[[YINXING]]|publisher=[[MythYLHB]]}}</ref>

|content2=
* April 1st - '''Kaleido Gaming''' reforms with a roster consisting of [[SPine]], [[rage (Chinese player)|rage]], [[suki]], [[SasiKi]], and [[chuzhongT]]. <ref name="2026 Kaleido Gaming">{{inside source|source=SPine, rage, rubeN, YINXING}}</ref>
}}

