'''Legacy''' (briefly known as '''Fake Natty''') is a [[:Category:Brazil|Brazilian]] professional esports organization founded in 2023 when [[00 Nation]]'s Brazilian division split from the company.

==Timeline==
{{Tabs dynamic
|name1=2023
|name2=2024
|name3=2025
|name4=2026
|This=4

|content1=
* August 15th - '''Fake Natty''' is formed with the separation of [[00 Nation]]'s Brazilian division, taking the Brazilian lineup and staff with them. <ref name="fake natty">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/ZeroZeroBRASIL/status/1691469037044465664|title=NOVIDADES EM BREVE|trans_title=NEWS COMING SOON|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|date=2023-08-15|author=[[00 Nation]]}}</ref>
* August 17th - '''Fake Natty''' transfer [[b4rtiN]] from their [[:valorant:00_Nation|''VALORANT'' division]] onto the team as an inactive player. <ref name="+b4rtiN">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/b4rtiNfps/status/1692204800442618132|title=Salve, Galera! Venho informar que com o fim da @ZeroZeroBRASIL, estou aberto à propostas de CS|trans_title=Hail, Guys! I come to inform you that with the end of @ZeroZeroBRASIL, I am open to CS proposals|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|date=2023-08-17|author=[[b4rtiN]]}}</ref>
* September 22nd - '''Fake Natty'''<nowiki>'s</nowiki> new name is revealed as '''Legacy'''. <ref>{{cite_web|url=https://twitter.com/legacyggbr/status/1705228689376415977|title=CHEGAMOS!|trans_title=WE ARRIVED!|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|date=2023-09-22|author='''Legacy'''}}</ref>
* September 26th - '''Legacy''' release [[TACO]]. <ref name="-TACO">{{cite_web|url=https://twitter.com/TACOCS/status/1706777099908923450|title=After some time off, I’m here to announce that I’m ready to my return!|date=2023-09-26|author=[[TACO]]}}</ref>
* October 16th - '''Legacy''' loan [[b4rtiN]] to [[RED Canids]]. <ref name="b4rtiN loan">{{cite_web|url=https://twitter.com/REDCanids/status/1714024729537904912|title=A bala vai voltar a voar, matilha!|trans_title=The bullet will fly again, pack!|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|date=2023-10-16|author=[[RED Canids]]}}</ref>
* October 25th - '''Legacy''' bench [[nqz]] and recall [[b4rtiN]] from [[RED Canids]] as his replacement. <ref name="nqz bench">{{cite_web|url=https://twitter.com/legacyggbr/status/1717278814319841593|title=Hoje viemos anunciar que o @nqzcs foi movido ao banco de reservas|trans_title=Today we came to announce that @nqzcs has been moved to the reserve bench|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|date=2023-10-25|author='''Legacy'''}}</ref><ref name="b4rtiN back">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/legacyggbr/status/1717338300980072614|date=2023-10-25|title=Ele voltou pra fechar o trio|trans_title=He came back to close the trio|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|author='''Legacy'''}}</ref>
* November 11th - [[nqz]] is acquired by [[paiN Gaming]]. <ref name="-nqz">{{cite_web|url=https://twitter.com/paiNGamingBR/status/1723354931946492037|title=COLA NÓIS @nqzcs E @n1ssimV!|trans_title=GLUE US @nqzcs AND @n1ssimV!|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|date=2023-11-11|author=[[paiN Gaming]]}}</ref>

|content2=
* March 25th - '''Legacy''' bench [[coldzera]] by mutual agreement. <ref name="coldzera bench">{{cite_web|url=https://twitter.com/legacyggbr/status/1772256044900569155|title=Hoje anunciamos que o @coldzera foi movido ao banco de reservas em comum acordo|trans_title=Today we announce that @coldzera has been moved to the reserve bench by mutual agreement|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|date=2024-03-25|author='''Legacy'''}}</ref>
* March 29th - '''Legacy''' add [[Stewie2K]] as a stand-in. <ref name="+Stewie2K">{{cite_web|url=https://twitter.com/legacyggbr/status/1773870164615770583|title=Coé @Stewie!|trans_title=Yo @Stewie!|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|date=2024-03-29|author='''Legacy'''}}</ref>
* April 18th - '''Legacy''' release [[coldzera]]. <ref name="-coldzera">{{cite_web|url=https://twitter.com/coldzera/status/1781115343483568508|title=Gostaria de comunicar a todos que n integro mais a organização Legacy|trans_title=I would like to inform everyone that I am no longer part of the Legacy organization|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|date=2024-04-18|author=[[coldzera]]}}</ref>
