* July 9th - '''Luminosity Gaming''' replace [[NAF]] with [[Devilwalk]]. <ref name="Luminosity sign Devilwalk">{{cite web|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20150711172355/http://luminosity.gg/articles/news/gaming/16/devilwalk-signs-with-lg-csgo-team|archivedate=2015-07-11|url=http://luminosity.gg/articles/news/gaming/16/devilwalk-signs-with-lg-csgo-team|title=Devilwalk signs with LG CS:GO team|publisher='''Luminosity Gaming'''}}</ref>
